          <attvalue for="33" value="-" />
          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained spikes in oil prices increase energy, transport and construction costs and can force delays or downscaling of capital‑intensive fab buildouts, slowing the expansion of advanced‑node production capacity." />
