          <attvalue for="36" value="Spikes in bond market volatility push investors into risk‑off mode and raise uncertainty about sovereign/counterparty solvency, which directly widens region‑ and country‑specific geopolitical risk premia (insurance rates, spreads) tied to Iran and regional exposures." />
